{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2021-12-06 06:50:00', 'title': 'BD SELECTS "EMBECTA" AS NAME OF NEW COMPANY FOR PLANNED SPINOFF OF DIABETES CARE BUSINESS; ANNOUNCES REMAINDER OF LEADERSHIP TEAM', 'text': 'FRANKLIN LAKES, N.J., DEC. 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BD (BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY) (NYSE: BDX), A LEADING GLOBAL MEDICAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED\xa0THAT "EMBECTA" [PRONOUNCED EM-BECK-TAH] WILL BE THE NAME OF THE INDEPENDENT, PUBLICLY-TRADED COMPANY THAT WILL HOLD BD\'S DIABETES CARE BUSINESS UPON THE COMPLETION OF THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED SPINOFF, WHICH IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE IN THE SECOND QUARTER OF CALENDAR YEAR 2022.'}